  "description": "The age of her marriage partner is 48 years old.\nSong Yeon-Ju is forced to get married because of money.\nHer opinion was completely ignored by the family, who asked her to repay their kindness for having her raised.\n\n“I don’t want a young and pretty mother like you.”\n\nKang I-Won, 2 years younger than her, is her soon-to-be stepson.\nHe is the only one who discusses the flow of marriage.",
